    "# Wachstum\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "67298933",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Definition\n",
    "\n",
    "....\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "N(t) = N_0 \\cdot a^t\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Bei dieser Form, wenn:\n",
    "\n",
    "$a > 1$: Wachstum\n",
    "\n",
    "$0 < a < 1$: Zerfall\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "N(t) = N_0 \\cdot e^{\\lambda \\cdot t}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Wenn Lambda vorhanden:\n",
    "\n",
    "$\\lambda > 0$: Wachstum\n",
    "\n",
    "$\\lambda < 0$: Wachstum\n",
    "\n",
    "$a = e^{\\lambda}$\n",
    "\n",
    "$ln(e) = \\lambda$"
   ]
